(text "DRAGON LAMP - MODULE WIRING SCHEMATIC" (at 15 14 0) (effects (font (size 3 3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ead99855-e1af-4ab6-a749-5123ff09bf0e))
(text "Official KiCad 8 symbols. J1 follows supplied physical row order: 5V, GND, 3V3, 13, 12, 11, 10, 9. Other connectors are wired interfaces." (at 15 20 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid fab60cf6-988f-4f50-9a82-e9d59b249d54))
(text "J2: 1=5V, 2=GND, 3=DIN" (at 125 57 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 93fa2036-02fb-45e6-8fff-1561e4c08801))
(text "J3: 1=3V3, 2=GND, 3=OUT" (at 190 57 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 3e83ac20-cba6-4b0f-9805-ae4bd652b226))
(text "LIGHT DIVIDER" (at 245 49 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 57069a16-4c4e-4676-9b41-f5da75ba6932))
(text "SUPPLY DIVIDER" (at 325 49 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid b8c4b53d-e96f-414a-8962-289c1b5b613a))
(text "J4: 1=VBUS, 2=GND. Existing USB-C breakout includes CC resistors; D+/D- unused." (at 15 214 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 54024b4e-7d06-4a19-85bc-842ecd7a2217))
(text "Use PC USB into ESP32 OR external 5V at J4; never both powered without source isolation." (at 15 219 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid af07a33f-c909-44a3-ab35-8887923fc2b3))
(text "External supply: branch matrix power directly from source. All grounds common. 1000uF bulk capacitor is OFF BOARD across USB breakout VBUS/GND." (at 15 224 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 6ec39481-cb92-45f4-bc8f-faac9fa39366))
(text "TTP223 and LDR share 3.3V. C2 is PCB bypass; keep a 100nF bypass near the remote TTP223 too. C4 is near GPIO10. C3 is optional filtering." (at 15 229 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 74a09623-447a-4112-895e-45147ef28c56))
(text "Divider: GPIO10 = VBUS / 6; at 5.00V expect 0.833V. J5: 1=3V3, 2=GPIO9 to remote LDR. No microphone." (at 15 234 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 24670309-cd15-459a-a10e-10056e17a1ec))
(text "Direct 3.3V LED data matches prototype; add a suitable 5V logic buffer if required by the actual matrix." (at 15 239 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 5b2ae4a3-303a-473e-8921-cec388142995))
